<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Pune to Greater Noida | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a bike from Pune to Greater Noida?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of approximately 850 km via NH 19 usually takes 18‑22 hours of road travel. Including loading, unloading, and any scheduled stops for safety checks, most customers receive their bike at the Greater Noida doorstep within 2‑3 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken to prevent scratches or damage during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is wrapped in a dedicated scratch‑guard film, then placed inside a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system that includes bubble wrap, foam edge protectors, and corrugated sheets. The bike is secured on a hydraulic ramp trailer with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, ensuring zero‑scratch transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the bike transport service from Pune to Greater Noida?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every bike transfer is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. The policy protects against loss, theft, and accidental damage, giving you full financial peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it travels from Pune to Greater Noida?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our specialized trucks are equipped with satellite‑based GPS live‑tracking. You receive a unique tracking link after pickup, allowing you to monitor the exact location of your bike along the NH 19 corridor in real time.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for booking bike transport from Pune to Greater Noida?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, and a signed consignment note. For corporate or government reimbursements, we also provide GST‑compliant invoices and e‑Way bills that meet IBA mover code standards.</p>
      </div>
